# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 检出把 LF 变成 CRLF 造成整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则老式 cmd 解析可能出错
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 大体积数据文件按二进制处理，不做行尾转换、不参与 diff 高亮
*.jsonl -text
anima-tag-kb/tags.json -text

# 二进制资源明确标注
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
